{"id":"52fd5856a06d2543","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-comprandom.md","title":"可计算随机性","display":"df-comprandom — 可计算随机性","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","aliases":["43-df-comprandom"],"display":"df-comprandom — 可计算随机性","label":"43-df-comprandom","type":"definition","depends_on":["[[43-df-computable-martingale]]","[[43-df-covers]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.2 Definition 10.2.3，印刷214，PDF234","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-comprandom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-comprandom — 可计算随机性"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-comprandom"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4aa7579d0d4e75dc\" href=\"?note=4aa7579d0d4e75dc\" title=\"43-df-computable-martingale\">43-df-computable-martingale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b31a1edfb1ee2862\" href=\"?note=b31a1edfb1ee2862\" title=\"43-df-covers\">43-df-covers</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.2 Definition 10.2.3，印刷214，PDF234"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4aa7579d0d4e75dc\" href=\"?note=4aa7579d0d4e75dc\" title=\"43-df-computable-martingale\">43-df-computable-martingale</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Covers}\">\\(\\mathrm{Covers}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b31a1edfb1ee2862\" href=\"?note=b31a1edfb1ee2862\" title=\"43-df-covers\">43-df-covers</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，以下Assertion给出其定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall d\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}(d)\\Rightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Covers}(d,X)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall d\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}(d)\\Rightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Covers}(d,X)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>使用实值有效Cauchy计算接口，而非只适用于离散输入输出的Computable(d)。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.2 Definition 10.2.3，印刷214，PDF234。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"4aa7579d0d4e75dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable-martingale]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-covers","status":"resolved","id":"b31a1edfb1ee2862","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-covers]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"4aa7579d0d4e75dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；$d$ 遍历 $2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$。$\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}$ 见 [[43-df-computable-martingale]]，$\\mathrm{Covers}$ 见 [[43-df-covers]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-covers","status":"resolved","id":"b31a1edfb1ee2862","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；$d$ 遍历 $2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$。$\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}$ 见 [[43-df-computable-martingale]]，$\\mathrm{Covers}$ 见 [[43-df-covers]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Covers}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall d\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}(d)\\Rightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Covers}(d,X)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1215,"backlinks":[{"id":"8ebdea3e9c19b1bf","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-comprandom]]，$\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}^A$ 见 [[43-df-rel-comprandom]]。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-163","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-comprandom]] — 可计算随机性"},{"id":"19939733116e21d8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"随机性谓词见 [[43-df-schnorrrandom]]、[[43-df-comprandom]]。"},{"id":"c43e6e534a61346e","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；跳跃、归约及随机性见 [[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-comprandom]]、[[43-df-schno